# QA harness outputs (large; do not commit by default — pin a baseline with: git add -f <path>)

# Generated QA/report outputs
reports/
qa-evidence-audit/help-center/

# Phase D2 daily simulator outputs (already covered by reports/, listed
# explicitly so intent is obvious to readers / future cleanups). The
# canonical longitudinal state file lives OUTSIDE the repo (default
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\liosh-qa\virtual-student-state on Windows) and is
# overrideable via VIRTUAL_STUDENT_DAILY_STATE_DIR. These two paths only
# catch local debugging copies that may end up under the repo's reports/.
reports/virtual-student-daily/
reports/virtual-student-longitudinal/

